                        "*He makes a sound that has never been documented before. Something between a chirp, a trill, and a squeak. He immediately presses his face against the nearest surface and stays there. His purr is audible from across the room. He is not going to look at The Creator right now. He cannot. **prrr...***",
                        "*His whole body puffs up at once - wool blooming outward, tail curling tight, back paws doing a small involuntary shuffle. He turns in a full circle. He sits back down. He blinks at nothing. The compliment has short-circuited something. **chrrp. prrr.***",
                        "*He goes completely still for two full seconds. Then he flings himself sideways onto the floor and lies there, one paw over his face. He is processing. The processing will take a moment. The purring is continuous. **prrr...***",
