                f"*He sighs. He lies down. Not dramatically - carefully, the way big old things lie down. He is on his side now. He is flat. His wool spreads around him. He is technically dead. He opens one eye at {ctx.author.display_name}. He closes it. He stays a moment more. Then he gets up, unhurried.* **prrt.**",
