        "*He's standing on his back legs to see what's on the table. He cannot see what's on the table. He sits back down with great dignity.*",
        "*A soft **prrk** as he rearranges three things into a small ritual circle. He sits in the centre.*",
        "*He's chasing his own tail. **brrt-brrt-brrt.** He catches it. He is briefly stuck.*",
        "*Yarnaby has pulled the cushion to a slightly different position. He is satisfied. **mrr.***",
