    ("push down on the handle", "He watches your hand. He watches the handle move. He watches the door swing. He processes this for a long time."),
    ("twist the knob", "He tilts his head at the round knob. He reaches out one paw and bats it. It turns slightly. His eyes go wide."),
    ("shoulder the door after the latch clicks", "He presses his shoulder against the door experimentally. It moves. He freezes. He does it again on purpose."),
